5. Multi-Row / Multi-Item Rule (IMPORTANT):
   - If the invoice table contains more than one row under Sl.no (i.e., multiple trucks/consignments billed on one invoice), DO NOT collapse them into single scalar fields.
   - Instead, emit a "line_items" array, with ONE object per ACTUAL consignment/Sl.no/C.N.No — never one object per amount line. The number of line_items objects must equal the number of consignments on the invoice (e.g., 4 consignments → 4 line_items objects, not 8).
   - Each object contains exactly these row-level fields: date, truck_no, fo_no, description, lr_no, type, gatepass_no, our_invoice_number, freight, st_charges.
